The flagged candidate is `assumePolicy`. Its name asserts *assumption*, but the body now does the opposite:

```typescript
const assumePolicy = (ledger: Ledger, stepIndex: number): Policy => {
  const policy = ledger.policies.get(stepIndex);
  if (policy === undefined) throw new ClaimOfficeError(`No policy created by step ${stepIndex}`);
  return policy;
};
```

Assessment:
